+// sidebar Y56 (BACKLOG S-483), spaces B12: in the rail's grid a row
+// dragged over the stack lights the dot under the pointer in its place --
+// the right one of its line, here -- and the lit dot fills its cell without
+// moving any other chip. A rest on it switches the window there, and the
